Package: PQA
Title: Perform the Pearson-Quetelet Analysis on Two-Way Contingency
        Tables
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
        person("Boris", "Mirkin", email = "boris.mirkin@bbk.ac.uk", role = "aut"),
        person("Luca", "Coraggio", email = "luca.coraggio@unina.it", role = c("aut", "cre")),
        person("Trevor", "Fenner", email = "t.fenner@bbk.ac.uk", role = "aut"),
        person("Zina", "Taran", email = "ztaran@gmail.com", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Tools to perform Pearson-Quetelet analysis on two-way contingency
    tables. The package computes absolute and relative frequencies, Quetelet
    indices, Pearson-Quetelet decomposition, apex tables, and chi-square
    summaries for interpreting associations between categorical variables.
